diff --git a/changelog.d/pr505.feature.rst b/changelog.d/pr505.feature.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ab7ce72
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr505.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+All :command:`pysemver` subcommands now accept an optional leading ``v`` or ``V`` on version arguments (for example a git tag like ``v1.4.2``). The output never contains the prefix.
diff --git a/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst b/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2798a8b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Passing a :class:`dict` to :meth:`semver.version.Version.compare` is deprecated and now emits a :class:`DeprecationWarning`. Pass a :class:`str`, :class:`tuple`, :class:`list` or :class:`~semver.version.Version` instead.
diff --git a/changelog.d/pr507.trivial.rst b/changelog.d/pr507.trivial.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3babda8
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr507.trivial.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+:meth:`semver.version.Version.next_version` now names its prerelease keyword ``token``, matching :meth:`~semver.version.Version.bump_prerelease`. The old ``prerelease_token=`` keyword is still accepted.
